<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico drains 523 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico drains 523 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned both auctions whereby it had sought to drain 523 million pesos from the secondary market on Monday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM     AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    380 million    17 days  24.08 pct</p>
<p>    143 million     1 days  23.94 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559))</p>
